Searu
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 24 DEAL OJIOZ
OJIOZ 2 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE OJIOZ OJIOZ
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Suit match
        SRC Rank K
    DEST Size <= 0
MOVE_STACK OJIOZ OJIOZ
AND
    OR
        DEST Rank 1
        DEST Size == 4
    DEST Rank 1
DRAW
PILE ALL OJIOZ Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL OJIOZ Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
